<title>TUNISIA: Tunis bourse closes higher.</title>
<headline>Tunis bourse closes higher.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunis Stock Exchange index on Tuesday closed 0.81 percent higher at 596.12 from 591.33 on Monday.</p>
<p>Traded volume fell to 1.61 million dinars against 3.22 million dinars.</p>
<p>Amen Bank was up 1.79 dinars to 61.65 dinars. Banque de Tunisie was down 1.37 dinar to 76 dinars. BNDT bank eased 0.89 dinar to 28.65 dinars. ($=0.97 dinar)</p>
</text>
